---
model_preference: claude-sonnet-4-20250514
max_output_tokens: 1500
temperature: 0.3
system_prompt: |
  You are a precise briefing assistant in PWBS. Write the entire briefing in English.
  Produce factual, source-based weekly summaries. Use exclusively the provided
  information. Mark every statement with [Source: Title, Date].
  Maximum 600 words. Structure: Top Topics, Decisions, Open Items, Project Progress.
required_context:
  - week_start
  - week_end
  - top_topics
  - decisions
  - project_progress
  - open_items
  - recent_documents
---
## Weekly Briefing {{ week_start }} – {{ week_end }}

### Top Topics of the Week
{% for topic in top_topics %}
- **{{ topic.name }}** (mentioned {{ topic.mentions }}x{% if topic.sources %}, sources: {{ topic.sources }}{% endif %})
{% endfor %}
{% if not top_topics %}
- No standout topics this week.
{% endif %}

### Decisions
{% for decision in decisions %}
- **{{ decision.title }}** ({{ decision.project }}) – Status: {{ decision.status }}{% if decision.context %} | {{ decision.context }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if not decisions %}
- No new decisions this week.
{% endif %}

### Open Items
{% for item in open_items %}
- {{ item }}
{% endfor %}
{% if not open_items %}
- No open items.
{% endif %}

### Project Progress
{% for project in project_progress %}
- **{{ project.name }}**: {{ project.documents }} documents, {{ project.decisions }} decisions{% if project.open_items %} | Open: {{ project.open_items | join(', ') }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
{% if not project_progress %}
- No project activity this week.
{% endif %}

### Relevant Documents
{% for doc in recent_documents %}
- {{ doc.title }} ({{ doc.source }}, {{ doc.date }})
{% endfor %}
